{'symbol': 'SYF', 'date': '2022-10-20 16:30:00', 'title': 'SYNCHRONY ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.23 PER SHARE', 'text': 'COMPANY ALSO DECLARES PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDEND STAMFORD, CONN. , OCT. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL (NYSE: SYF) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.23 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 10, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 1, 2022.'}